    counters - recordingressrst statuscode counters - recordingressgoaway statuscode   
    
  callback - onabort stream  statuscode httpcodecstatsfilter  ongoaway uint64 t lastgoodstreamid  
                                    errorcode statuscode  
                                    std  unique ptr folly  iobuf  debugdata    
  counters - recordingressgoaway statuscode lastgoodstreamid    http2  kmaxstreamid    
    counters - recordingressgoawaydrain    
    
  callback - ongoaway lastgoodstreamid  statuscode  std  move debugdata httpcodecstatsfilter  onpingrequest uint64 t data    
  counters - recordingresspingrequest    
  callback - onpingrequest data httpcodecstatsfilter  onpingreply uint64 t data    
  counters - recordingresspingreply    
  callback - onpingreply data httpcodecstatsfilter  onwindowupdate streamid stream  uint32 t amount    
